OL,3,ATrump, Xi and Putin set to hold
OL,4,Ahistoric meeting on Apec sidelines
OL,5,
OL,6,FChina's Xi Jinping, US President Donald
OL,7,FTrump and Russia's Vladimir Putin will
OL,8,Fhold historic talks in China on
OL,9,FThursday - the first time the leaders
OL,10,Fof these countries have held a formal
OL,11,Fmeeting
OL,13,FThe trio are attending the Asia-Pacific
OL,14,FEconomic Co-operation (Apec) summit in
OL,15,Fthe southern Chinese city of Shenzhen,
OL,16,Fwhere they have been pictured shaking
OL,17,Fhands
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
